{"version":1,"content":"<p>音頻設備廠商Bose宣佈完成對耳機品牌 Skullcandy 的收購。儘管雙方同屬消費音頻市場競爭者，但近年來兩家公司已經建立合作關係，此次收購被視為Bose擴大品牌覆蓋範圍、接觸更多消費羣體的重要一步。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583270.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.189459+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:37:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"0de0ba58fa673c13ca0535c9a8d449edc5f73aa8d91cc80b22b98dd308157022","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}